    "detailed_description": "Manav is greengrocer game. Your character gathers his product from garden and sells at town.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour main character have a garden with lemon trees, onion plants, garlic plants, parsley plants. You can gather these resources unlimited.<br />\r\nPlants will grow again after few seconds you gather resources. Gathered resources will go to your boxes in the town. <br />\r\nYou can carry 3 resources in the town. After select your 3 target resources, you will search for customer who wanted these resources.<br />\r\nIf character find customer who wanted any of these resources, can sell his product and gain money. Manav is easy, relaxing game about this gathering and selling resources circle.",
